        "original_id": "95ab94d4-7433-5a52-af78-cf10016caf55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Valeria Golino, Tom Cruise, Dustin Hoffman, Vincenzo Amato, Francesco Casisa\n- Films: Rain Man, Big Top Pee-wee, Hot Shots!, Respiro\n- Characters: Charlie Babbitt, Raymond\n- Concepts: autistic savant, inheritance\n\nFacts:\n- Valeria Golino is best known to English-language audiences for her roles in the films Big Top Pee-wee, Rain Man, and Hot Shots!.\n- Rain Man tells the story of Charlie Babbitt, an abrasive and selfish young wheeler-dealer played by Tom Cruise.\n- In Rain Man, Charlie Babbitt learns that his estranged father has died and left his multimillion-dollar estate to Raymond, Charlie's previously unknown brother.\n- In Rain Man, Raymond is an autistic savant played by Dustin Hoffman.\n- Respiro stars Valeria Golino, Vincenzo Amato, and Francesco Casisa.",
